      "threadId": "chessnut companion update – chessnut next & ai coach now available",
      "name": "Dr. Jörn Gehring",
      "email": "joern@chessconnect.de",
      "subject": "Re: Chessnut Companion Update – Chessnut Next & AI Coach Now Available",
      "summary": "Hi Stella, thank you for the update. Does this new version of Chessnut Next provide the AIDL interface? Cheers, Jörn (from Chessconnect) --Apple-Mail=_B187EA26-A48F-41FE-A250-FB34062298D1 Content-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable Content-Type: text/html; cha",
      "body": "Hi Stella,\n\nthank you for the update. Does this new version of Chessnut Next provide the AIDL interface?\n\nCheers,\n\nJörn (from Chessconnect)\n\n> Am 22.07.2026 um 09:00 schrieb Stella Zhuang :\n>\n> Dear all,\n>\n> I hope you’ve all had a chance to try out the Chessnut Companion. I have two updates to share with you:\n>\n> 1. Chessnut Next is now live.\n> You can check for the update directly in the app. It’s also available for download from the app store. If you’re unable to access it through either method, please send me the email address associated with your app store account, and I’ll look into it.\n>\n> 2. The AI Coach is now available.\n> Please note that it currently supports post-game analysis only. Real-time analysis is expected to be ready in about two weeks. We’d really love to hear your feedback once you’ve had a chance to test it out.\n>\n> To make sure you have enough points for testing, please send me your Chessnut account email. We’ll top up your credits accordingly so you can fully explore the features and share them with your audience.\n>\n> Looking forward to your feedback.\n>\n> Best,\n> Stella\n> Business Development Manager | Chessnut\n\n--Apple-Mail=_B187EA26-A48F-41FE-A250-FB34062298D1\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable\nContent-Type: text/html;\ncharset=utf-8\n\nHi Stella, thank you for the update. Does this new version of Chessnut Next provide the AIDL interface? Cheers, Jörn (from Chessconnect) Am 22.07.2026 um 09:00 schrieb Stella Zhuang &lt;stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com&gt;: Dear all, I hope you’ve all had a chance to try out the Chessnut Companion. I have two updates to share with you: 1. Chessnut Next is now live. You can check for the update directly in the app. It’s also available for download from the app store. If you’re unable to access it through either method, please send me the email address associated with your app store account, and I’ll look into it. 2. The AI Coach is now available. Please note that it currently supports post-game analysis only. Real-time analysis is expected to be ready in about two weeks. We’d really love to hear your feedback once you’ve had a chance to test it out. To make sure you have enough points for testing, please send me your Chessnut account email. We’ll top up your credits accordingly so you can fully explore the features and share them with your audience. Looking forward to your feedback. Best, Stella Business Development Manager | Chessnut\n--Apple-Mail=_B187EA26-A48F-41FE-A250-FB34062298D1--",
      "bodyChinese": "Hi Stella,\n\nthank you for the update. Does this new version of Chessnut Next provide the AIDL interface?\n\nCheers,\n\nJörn (from Chessconnect)\n\n> Am 22.07.2026 um 09:00 schrieb Stella Zhuang :\n>\n> Dear all,\n>\n> I hope you’ve all had a chance to try out the Chessnut Companion. I have two updates to share with you:\n>\n> 1. Chessnut Next is now live.\n> You can check for the update directly in the app. It’s also available for download from the app store. If you’re unable to access it through either method, please send me the email address associated with your app store account, and I’ll look into it.\n>\n> 2. The AI Coach is now available.\n> Please note that it currently supports post-game analysis only. Real-time analysis is expected to be ready in about two weeks. We’d really love to hear your feedback once you’ve had a chance to test it out.\n>\n> To make sure you have enough points for testing, please send me your Chessnut account email. We’ll top up your credits accordingly so you can fully explore the features and share them with your audience.\n>\n> Looking forward to your feedback.\n>\n> Best,\n> Stella\n> Business Development Manager | Chessnut\n\n--Apple-Mail=_B187EA26-A48F-41FE-A250-FB34062298D1\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable\nContent-Type: text/html;\ncharset=utf-8\n\nHi Stella, thank you for the update. Does this new version of Chessnut Next provide the AIDL interface? Cheers, Jörn (from Chessconnect) Am 22.07.2026 um 09:00 schrieb Stella Zhuang &lt;stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com&gt;: Dear all, I hope you’ve all had a chance to try out the Chessnut Companion. I have two updates to share with you: 1. Chessnut Next is now live. You can check for the update directly in the app. It’s also available for download from the app store. If you’re unable to access it through either method, please send me the email address associated with your app store account, and I’ll look into it. 2. The AI Coach is now available. Please note that it currently supports post-game analysis only. Real-time analysis is expected to be ready in about two weeks. We’d really love to hear your feedback once you’ve had a chance to test it out. To make sure you have enough points for testing, please send me your Chessnut account email. We’ll top up your credits accordingly so you can fully explore the features and share them with your audience. Looking forward to your feedback. Best, Stella Business Development Manager | Chessnut\n--Apple-Mail=_B187EA26-A48F-41FE-A250-FB34062298D1--",
      "summaryChinese": "Hi Stella, thank you for the update. Does this new version of Chessnut Next provide the AIDL interface? Cheers, Jörn (from Chessconnect) --Apple-Mail=_B187EA26-A48F-41FE-A250-FB34062298D1 Content-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable Content-Type: text/html; cha",
