      "summary": "New support request from Chessnut website: Name: Marcus Chan Email: ckw0366@gmail.com Order Number: N/A Inquiry Type: Business / Partnership Product: Other / Not sure Description: Dear Square Off Team,",
      "body": "New support request from Chessnut website:\n\nName: Marcus Chan\nEmail: ckw0366@gmail.com\nOrder Number: N/A\nInquiry Type: Business / Partnership\nProduct: Other / Not sure\n\nDescription:\nDear Square Off Team,\n\nI hope this email finds you well.\n\nMy name is Marcus, and I am based in Malaysia. I am interested in exploring the possibility of introducing and selling Square Off AI chess products in the Malaysian market.\n\nI would like to understand whether Square Off is currently looking for distributors, resellers, or local partners in Malaysia. I believe there is potential demand among chess communities, schools, international schools, and technology enthusiasts in Malaysia for an AI-powered smart chess board.\n\nCould you please provide more information regarding:\n\n1. Distributor or reseller partnership opportunities in Malaysia\n2. Minimum order quantities (MOQ)\n3. Wholesale pricing and available product models\n4. Shipping arrangements and warranty support for Malaysia\n5. Marketing support provided to local partners\n\nI would appreciate the opportunity to discuss a potential collaboration with your team.\n\nThank you, and I look forward to your reply.\n\nBest regards,\n\nMarcus\nMalaysia\n\nVideo Link: N/A\n\n---\nSubmitted via Chessnut Contact Form",
      "bodyChinese": "New support request from Chessnut website:\n\nName: Marcus Chan\nEmail: ckw0366@gmail.com\nOrder Number: N/A\nInquiry Type: Business / Partnership\nProduct: Other / Not sure\n\nDescription:\nDear Square Off Team,\n\nI hope this email finds you well.\n\nMy name is Marcus, and I am based in Malaysia. I am interested in exploring the possibility of introducing and selling Square Off AI chess products in the Malaysian market.\n\nI would like to understand whether Square Off is currently looking for distributors, resellers, or local partners in Malaysia. I believe there is potential demand among chess communities, schools, international schools, and technology enthusiasts in Malaysia for an AI-powered smart chess board.\n\nCould you please provide more information regarding:\n\n1. Distributor or reseller partnership opportunities in Malaysia\n2. Minimum order quantities (MOQ)\n3. Wholesale pricing and available product models\n4. Shipping arrangements and warranty support for Malaysia\n5. Marketing support provided to local partners\n\nI would appreciate the opportunity to discuss a potential collaboration with your team.\n\nThank you, and I look forward to your reply.\n\nBest regards,\n\nMarcus\nMalaysia\n\nVideo Link: N/A\n\n---\nSubmitted via Chessnut Contact Form",
