      "body": "New support request from Chessnut website:\n\nName: Shaun Stanfield\nEmail: seriousmangobusiness@gmail.com\nOrder Number: N/A\nInquiry Type: Business / Partnership\nProduct: Other / Not sure\n\nDescription:\nHi Chessnut team,\n\nMy name is Shaun, and I’m the creator of Serious Mango, a YouTube channel where I create high-quality anime-inspired chess animations.\n\nI recently launched an animated chess series featuring popular figures from the online chess community. The first episode has reached over 317,000 views, 4.4 million impressions, and gained 3,000 subscribers for my channel.\n\nI just released Part 2, which has already reached 30,000+ views within its first two days, and I’m currently beginning production on Part 3.\n\nBecause Chessnut creates innovative products specifically for chess players, I think the brand would be a natural fit for my growing chess audience. I’d love to discuss having Chessnut sponsor Part 3 through an integrated placement within the video.\n\nPart 1: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3eE2cPGjenI\n\nI’d be happy to share additional analytics and discuss potential integration ideas if you’re interested.\n\nBest,\nShaun / Serious Mango\nYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/@Serious_Mango\nEmail: seriousmangobusiness@gmail.com\n\nVideo Link: N/A\n\n---\nSubmitted via Chessnut Contact Form",
      "bodyChinese": "New support request from Chessnut website:\n\nName: Shaun Stanfield\nEmail: seriousmangobusiness@gmail.com\nOrder Number: N/A\nInquiry Type: Business / Partnership\nProduct: Other / Not sure\n\nDescription:\nHi Chessnut team,\n\nMy name is Shaun, and I’m the creator of Serious Mango, a YouTube channel where I create high-quality anime-inspired chess animations.\n\nI recently launched an animated chess series featuring popular figures from the online chess community. The first episode has reached over 317,000 views, 4.4 million impressions, and gained 3,000 subscribers for my channel.\n\nI just released Part 2, which has already reached 30,000+ views within its first two days, and I’m currently beginning production on Part 3.\n\nBecause Chessnut creates innovative products specifically for chess players, I think the brand would be a natural fit for my growing chess audience. I’d love to discuss having Chessnut sponsor Part 3 through an integrated placement within the video.\n\nPart 1: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3eE2cPGjenI\n\nI’d be happy to share additional analytics and discuss potential integration ideas if you’re interested.\n\nBest,\nShaun / Serious Mango\nYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/@Serious_Mango\nEmail: seriousmangobusiness@gmail.com\n\nVideo Link: N/A\n\n---\nSubmitted via Chessnut Contact Form",
