      "summary": "Hi Stella, Yes, the Companion arrived safely. Thank you! I’m planning to make a video this month where I play using the Chessnut Move and the Companion together, and I’ll naturally introduce and mention the Companion during the video. I’m also happy to wait fo",
      "body": "Hi Stella,\n\nYes, the Companion arrived safely. Thank you!\n\nI’m planning to make a video this month where I play using the Chessnut Move\nand the Companion together, and I’ll naturally introduce and mention the\nCompanion during the video.\n\nI’m also happy to wait for the upcoming update before filming, so no\nproblem at all. Please send me the details once it is available.\n\nBest,\nYevhenii\n\nOn Fri, 10 Jul 2026 at 10:40, Stella Zhuang\nwrote:\n\n> Hey Yevhenii,\n>\n> Just checking — did the Companion arrive safely?\n> No pressure on the video at all, we actually have an update rolling out\n> next week, so you might want to wait until that's available before you\n> start filming. I'll send you the details once it's out.\n> Let me know if you have any questions!\n>\n> Best,\n> Stella\n> Business Development Manager | Chessnut\n>\n\nHi Stella, Yes, the Companion arrived safely. Thank you! I’m planning to make a video this month where I play using the Chessnut Move and the Companion together, and I’ll naturally introduce and mention the Companion during the video. I’m also happy to wait for the upcoming update before filming, so no problem at all. Please send me the details once it is available. Best, Yevhenii On Fri, 10 Jul 2026 at 10:40, Stella Zhuang &lt; stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com &gt; wrote: Hey Yevhenii, Just checking — did the Companion arrive safely? No pressure on the video at all, we actually have an update rolling out next week, so you might want to wait until that&#39;s available before you start filming. I&#39;ll send you the details once it&#39;s out. Let me know if you have any questions! Best, Stella Business Development Manager | Chessnut",
      "bodyChinese": "Hi Stella,\n\nYes, the Companion arrived safely. Thank you!\n\nI’m planning to make a video this month where I play using the Chessnut Move\nand the Companion together, and I’ll naturally introduce and mention the\nCompanion during the video.\n\nI’m also happy to wait for the upcoming update before filming, so no\nproblem at all. Please send me the details once it is available.\n\nBest,\nYevhenii\n\nOn Fri, 10 Jul 2026 at 10:40, Stella Zhuang\nwrote:\n\n> Hey Yevhenii,\n>\n> Just checking — did the Companion arrive safely?\n> No pressure on the video at all, we actually have an update rolling out\n> next week, so you might want to wait until that's available before you\n> start filming. I'll send you the details once it's out.\n> Let me know if you have any questions!\n>\n> Best,\n> Stella\n> Business Development Manager | Chessnut\n>\n\nHi Stella, Yes, the Companion arrived safely. Thank you! I’m planning to make a video this month where I play using the Chessnut Move and the Companion together, and I’ll naturally introduce and mention the Companion during the video. I’m also happy to wait for the upcoming update before filming, so no problem at all. Please send me the details once it is available. Best, Yevhenii On Fri, 10 Jul 2026 at 10:40, Stella Zhuang &lt; stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com &gt; wrote: Hey Yevhenii, Just checking — did the Companion arrive safely? No pressure on the video at all, we actually have an update rolling out next week, so you might want to wait until that&#39;s available before you start filming. I&#39;ll send you the details once it&#39;s out. Let me know if you have any questions! Best, Stella Business Development Manager | Chessnut",
