k more chess apps and include an AI coach to help improve your\n> game.\n>\n> If you're interested, could you please confirm your shipping address below?\n>\n> Name: Ivan Paquico Rodriguez\n> Address: Arcadi Balaguer 53, 3º, 1º\n> City: Castelldefels\n> Province: Barcelona\n> Post Code: 08860\n> Country: Spain\n> Phone: +34 660 638 967\n>\n> Best,\n> Stella\n> Business Development Manager | Chessnut\n>\n>\n\nHi Stella, Honestly, I love it! It looks stunning, and the build quality is amazing. You keep surprising me with every new product and update. I haven’t been able to give the clock the attention it deserves yet , as it arrived right in the middle of the biggest course launch I’ve ever done for my online chess academy. I’ve already shown it briefly to my community and shared my very positive first impressions, as I knew you were launching it in early July. However, I want to test it properly before creating dedicated content. The launch for my online academy finishes on the 19th, so I should be able to spend proper time with the clock by the end of this week or early next week. I’m also really looking forward to trying the AI commentary and the new app update! I genuinely value our long-term partnership and didn’t want you to think I had lost interest. Quite the opposite, it was simply unfortunate timing, and I want to create the content this product deserves. I’m sorry for the delay, and I’m really looking forward to giving the clock the attention it deserves. Best, Ivan El vie, 10 jul 2026 a las 11:43, Stella Zhuang (&lt; stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com &gt;) escribió: Hi Ivan, No worries — I&#39;ve already sent the reimbursement request to finance for you.Also, how&#39;s the chess clock treating you? Just a heads up, next week you&#39;ll be able to use the AI commentary and the new app update! Best, Stella Business Development Manager | Chessnut ------------------------------------------------------------------ 发件人：Resourchess &lt; hola@resourchess.com &gt; 发送时间