en shipped. Tracking number: CE051864235DE. Carrier: DHL. You\n> should be receiving it soon.\n>\n> Best,\n> Stella\n> Business Development Manager | Chessnut\n>\n> ------------------------------------------------------------------\n> 发件人：Joachim Mouhamad\n> 发送时间：2026年5月5日(周二) 04:42\n> 收件人：Stella Zhuang\n> 主 题：RE: 回复：回复：RE: Relance – Proposition de collaboration 2026\n>\n> Hi Stella,\n> Perfect, thanks a lot — looking forward to receiving it!\n> Best,\n> Joachim\n>\n> ------------------------------\n> *De :* Stella Zhuang\n> *Envoyé :* mercredi 29 avril 2026 10:55\n> *À :* Joachim Mouhamad\n> *Objet :* 回复：回复：RE: Relance – Proposition de collaboration 2026\n>\n> Hi Joachim,\n>\n> Thank you for the information. I've asked our warehouse to ship it out as\n> soon as it's in stock. Once I have the tracking number, I will share it\n> with you.\n>\n> Best,\n> Stella\n> Business Development Manager | Chessnut\n>\n> ------------------------------------------------------------------\n> 发件人：Joachim Mouhamad\n> 发送时间：2026年4月27日(周一) 21:56\n> 收件人：Stella Zhuang\n> 主 题：RE: 回复：RE: Relance – Proposition de collaboration 2026\n>\n> Hi Stella,\n> Thanks for your message!\n> I’m currently based in Las Palmas de Gran Canaria, where I live, so this\n> is a stable address and I’ll be able to receive the package there, even if\n> it ships in May.\n> Here are my shipping details:\n> Joachim Mouhamad\n> Calle Galileo 42, 3º Izquierda A\n> 35010 Las Palmas de Gran Canaria\n> Spain\n> +33 7 76 96 31 25\n> Please let me know if you need anything else on your side.\n> Best,\n> Joachim\n>\n> ------------------------------\n> *De :* Stella Zhuang\n> *Envoyé :* mercredi 22 avril 2026 12:19\n> *À :* Joachim Mouhamad\n> *Objet :* 回复：RE: Relance – Proposition de collaboration 2026\n>\n> Hi Joachim,\n>\n> How long will you be staying there? Just so you know, the Move is\n> currently out of stock and may not ship until May. If possible, it would be\n> better to provide a permanent address where you'll be 