      "subject": "Re: Follow-up Regarding Muhammad Amin & Chessnut Evo Collaboration",
      "summary": "Hi Stella, Thank you for your reply. It’s great to reconnect with you! We have not received the Chessnut EVO yet, and so far no one has contacted us regarding the shipment or delivery. We have already received our affiliate tracking link and promo code through",
      "body": "Hi Stella,\nThank you for your reply. It’s great to reconnect with you!\n\nWe have not received the Chessnut EVO yet, and so far no one has contacted\nus regarding the shipment or delivery.\n\nWe have already received our affiliate tracking link and promo code through\nUppromote:\n\nTracking link: https://www.chessnutech.com?sca_ref=11333622.z94ULHSHrK1sC\nPromo code: ABDULAZIZESHPULATOV11333622\n\nHowever, we have not yet received any update regarding the Chessnut EVO\nshipment.\n\nRegarding Muhammad Amin’s Instagram, I mentioned in my previous email that\nwe had to create a new account due to the previous account becoming\nunavailable.\n\nThe new account is @chess_by_amin. There may have been a temporary issue\nthat prevented the posts from appearing, but everything has now been\nresolved. I would really appreciate it if you could check the account again.\n\nThe account is active again, and Muhammad Amin’s recent Reels are once\nagain receiving excellent engagement and viral views. We are excited to\ncontinue growing the account and sharing high-quality chess content.\n\nWe truly hope to build a long-term partnership with Chessnut, and we are\nlooking forward to creating engaging content featuring the Chessnut EVO as\nsoon as it arrives.\n\nThank you for your support, and I look forward to hearing from you.\n\nBest regards,\nAbdulaziz Eshpulatov (on behalf of Muhammad Amin) Email:\njonabdulaziz@gmail.com\n\n>\n\nHi Stella, Thank you for your reply. It’s great to reconnect with you! We have not received the Chessnut EVO yet, and so far no one has contacted us regarding the shipment or delivery. We have already received our affiliate tracking link and promo code through Uppromote:  Tracking link: https://www.chessnutech.com?sca_ref=11333622.z94ULHSHrK1sC  Promo code: ABDULAZIZESHPULATOV11333622 However, we have not yet received any update regarding the Chessnut EVO shipment. Regarding Muhammad Amin’s Instagram, I mentioned in my previous email that we had to create a new account due to the previous account becoming unavailable. The new account is @chess_by_amin. There may have been a temporary issue that prevented the posts from appearing, but everything has now been resolved. I would really appreciate it if you could check the account again. The account is active again, and Muhammad Amin’s recent Reels are once again receiving excellent engagement and viral views. We are excited to continue growing the account and sharing high-quality chess content. We truly hope to build a long-term partnership with Chessnut, and we are looking forward to creating engaging content featuring the Chessnut EVO as soon as it arrives. Thank you for your support, and I look forward to hearing from you. Best regards, Abdulaziz Eshpulatov (on behalf of Muhammad Amin) Email: jonabdulaziz@gmail.com",
      "bodyChinese": "Hi Stella,\nThank you for your reply. It’s great to reconnect with you!\n\nWe have not received the Chessnut EVO yet, and so far no one has contacted\nus regarding the shipment or delivery.\n\nWe have already received our affiliate tracking link and promo code through\nUppromote:\n\nTracking link: https://www.chessnutech.com?sca_ref=11333622.z94ULHSHrK1sC\nPromo code: ABDULAZIZESHPULATOV11333622\n\nHowever, we have not yet received any update regarding the Chessnut EVO\nshipment.\n\nRegarding Muhammad Amin’s Instagram, I mentioned in my previous email that\nwe had to create a new account due to the previous account becoming\nunavailable.\n\nThe new account is @chess_by_amin. There may have been a temporary issue\nthat prevented the posts from appearing, but everything has now been\nresolved. I would really appreciate it if you could check the account again.\n\nThe account is active again, and Muhammad Amin’s recent Reels are once\nagain receiving excellent engagement and viral views. We are excited to\ncontinue growing the account and sharing high-quality chess content.\n\nWe truly hope to build a long-term partnership with Chessnut, and we are\nlooking forward to creating engaging content featuring the Chessnut EVO as\nsoon as it arrives.\n\nThank you for your support, and I look forward to hearing from you.\n\nBest regards,\nAbdulaziz Eshpulatov (on behalf of Muhammad Amin) Email:\njonabdulaziz@gmail.com\n\n>\n\nHi Stella, Thank you for your reply. It’s great to reconnect with you! We have not received the Chessnut EVO yet, and so far no one has contacted us regarding the shipment or delivery. We have already received our affiliate tracking link and promo code through Uppromote:  Tracking link: https://www.chessnutech.com?sca_ref=11333622.z94ULHSHrK1sC  Promo code: ABDULAZIZESHPULATOV11333622 However, we have not yet received any update regarding the Chessnut EVO shipment. Regarding Muhammad Amin’s Instagram, I mentioned in my previous email that we had to create a new account due to the previous account becoming unavailable. The new account is @chess_by_amin. There may have been a temporary issue that prevented the posts from appearing, but everything has now been resolved. I would really appreciate it if you could check the account again. The account is active again, and Muhammad Amin’s recent Reels are once again receiving excellent engagement and viral views. We are excited to continue growing the account and sharing high-quality chess content. We truly hope to build a long-term partnership with Chessnut, and we are looking forward to creating engaging content featuring the Chessnut EVO as soon as it arrives. Thank you for your support, and I look forward to hearing from you. Best regards, Abdulaziz Eshpulatov (on behalf of Muhammad Amin) Email: jonabdulaziz@gmail.com",
