      "summary": "Hey Stella, A single Reel as a trial works well on our end, especially with a path to a broader partnership if the results are there. Quick context on my role since you asked: I handle partnership sourcing and deal negotiation for a small roster of creators, a",
      "body": "Hey Stella,\n\nA single Reel as a trial works well on our end, especially with a path to a\nbroader partnership if the results are there.\n\nQuick context on my role since you asked: I handle partnership sourcing and\ndeal negotiation for a small roster of creators, and I collaborate with\nNemo's management on select opportunities.\n\nFor scope, we'd propose a dedicated Reel featuring the Chessnut board plus\n30 days of organic usage rights for your channels. Partnerships at this\nscope typically start around $7,000. Before I take this to her team to\nconfirm availability, it would help to know: does that align with the\nbudget you've set aside for this trial? If not, let me know where you're at\nand I'll see what scope we can build around it.\n\nLooking forward to your thoughts.\n\nThanks,\nPatrick\n\nOn Thu, Jul 9, 2026 at 1:26 AM Stella Zhuang\nwrote:\n\n> Hey Patrick,\n>\n> Thanks for your note.\n> We'd like to start with a single Reels collaboration to test the waters,\n> just a chance to see how our audiences respond.\n> We're open to a broader partnership down the road, but we believe in\n> starting small and proving the value first.\n> Before we move forward, just to confirm, are you the main point of contact\n> for Nemo's partnership inquiries, or is there another team we should loop\n> in?\n> Let us know your thoughts, and if you have a trial rate in mind, we're\n> happy to discuss.\n>\n> Best,\n> Stella\n> Business Development Manager | Chessnut\n>\n> ------------------------------------------------------------------\n> 发件人：Patrick Chua\n> 发送时间：2026年7月8日(周三) 02:03\n> 收件人：Stella Zhuang\n> 主 题：Re: NemoChess Partnership\n>\n> Hey Stella,\n>\n> Great to hear from you, and I'm glad you have context on Nemo!\n>\n> For a partnership like this, we'd typically structure it as gifting plus a\n> paid promotion. A standard package would look like:\n>\n> - 1x dedicated short-form video featuring the Chessnut board (concept\n> collaboratively developed, with Nemo's take on gameplay against the\n> auto-moving board)\n> - Posted across Nemo's platforms (TikTok, Instagram Reels, YouTube Shorts)\n> - 30 days of organic usage rights for Chessnut's channels\n>\n> We can also discuss integrated mentions, extended usage/whitelisting, or a\n> multi-video series if you're thinking bigger.\n>\n> Do you have a budget range in mind for creator partnerships this quarter?\n> Happy to tailor the package from there.\n>\n> Thanks,\n> Patrick\n>\n> On Tue, Jul 7, 2026 at 1:12 AM Stella Zhuang stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com> wrote:\n> Hi Patrick,\n>\n> Thank you for your message.We are certainly interested. As it happens, we\n> met in Hong Kong during the same tournament, so it’s a pleasure to\n> reconnect. Could you kindly share more information about your proposed\n> collaboration?\n>\n> Best,\n> Stella\n> Business Development Manager | Chessnut\n>\n> ------------------------------------------------------------------\n> 发件人：Patrick Chua\n> 发送时间：2026年6月23日(周二) 11:44\n> 收件人：\"stella.zhuang\"\n> 主 题：NemoChess Partnership\n>\n> Hey Stella,\n>\n> I manage some partnerships for a roster of creators, including @nemochess,\n> who I think would be a great fit for your brand!\n>\n> Would love to see if Chessnut would be interested in a collaboration!\n>\n> Looking forward to hearing from you.\n>\n> Thanks,\n> Patrick\n>\n>\n\nHey Stella, A single Reel as a trial works well on our end, especially with a path to a broader partnership if the results are there. Quick context on my role since you asked: I handle partnership sourcing and deal negotiation for a small roster of creators, and I collaborate with Nemo&#39;s management on select opportunities. For scope, we&#39;d propose a dedicated Reel featuring the Chessnut board plus 30 days of organic usage rights for your channels. Partnerships at this scope typically start around $7,000. Before I take this to her team to confirm availability, it would help to know: does that align with the budget you&#39;ve set aside for this trial? If not, let me know where you&#39;re at and I&#39;ll see what scope we can build around it. Looking forward to your thoughts. Thanks, Patrick On Thu, Jul 9, 2026 at 1:26 AM Stella Zhuang &lt; stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com &gt; wrote: Hey Patrick, Thanks for your note. We&#39;d like to start with a single Reels collaboration to test the waters, just a chance to see how our audiences respond. We&#39;re open to a broader partnership down the road, but we believe in starting small and proving the value first. Before we move forward, just to confirm, are you the main point of contact for Nemo&#39;s partnership inquiries, or is there another team we should loop in? Let us know your thoughts, and if you have a trial rate in mind, we&#39;re happy to discuss. Best, Stella Business Development Manager | Chessnut ------------------------------------------------------------------ 发件人：Patrick Chua &lt; patrick@activeseeding.com &gt; 发送时间：2026年7月8日(周三) 02:03 收件人：Stella Zhuang&lt; stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com &gt; 主　题：Re: NemoChess Partnership Hey Stella, Great to hear from you, and I&#39;m glad you have context on Nemo! For a partnership like this, we&#39;d typically structure it as gifting plus a paid promotion. A standard package would look like: - 1x dedicated short-form video featuring the Chessnut board (concept collaboratively developed, with Nemo&#39;s take on gameplay against the auto-moving board) - Posted across Nemo&#39;s platforms (TikTok, Instagram Reels, YouTube Shorts) - 30 days of organic usage rights for Chessnut&#39;s channels We can also discuss integrated mentions, extended usage/whitelisting, or a multi-video series if you&#39;re thinking bigger. Do you have a budget range in mind for creator partnerships this quarter? Happy to tailor the package from there. Thanks, Patrick On Tue, Jul 7, 2026 at 1:12 AM Stella Zhuang &lt; stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com &gt; wrote: Hi Patrick, Thank you for your message.We are certainly interested. As it happens, we met in Hong Kong during the same tournament, so it’s a pleasure to reconnect. Could you kindly share more information about your proposed collaboration? Best, Stella Business Development Manager | Chessnut ------------------------------------------------------------------ 发件人：Patrick Chua &lt; patrick@activeseeding.com &gt; 发送时间：2026年6月23日(周二) 11:44 收件人：&quot;stella.zhuang&quot;&lt; stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com &gt; 主　题：NemoChess Partnership Hey Stella, I manage some partnerships for a roster of creators, including @nemochess, who I think would be a great fit for your brand! Would love to see if Chessnut would be interested in a collaboration! Looking forward to hearing from you. Thanks, Patrick",
