ikhil, Sorry for the misunderstanding — I thought you were applying for the Chessnut Companion. If you are referring to any Chessnut board, I would be happy to send you an Air unit for testing. Since you are based in India, could you please provide the following details so that I can arrange the shipment promptly: Full Name Phone Number Postal Code Shipping Address Email Address Once I have this information, I will get the unit shipped out as soon as possible. Looking forward to your reply. Best, Stella Business Development Manager | Chessnut ------------------------------------------------------------------ 发件人：Chessis Support &lt; support@chessis.app &gt; 发送时间：2026年7月8日(周三) 20:10 收件人：Stella Zhuang&lt; stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com &gt; 抄　送：Chessis Support&lt; support@chessis.app &gt; 主　题：Re: Developer Partnership Request – Chessis × Chessnut Hi Stella, Thank you for getting back to me. I understand that review units are currently out of stock. I have already added Chessnut support to the beta version of the app and hope the integration works as expected; however, I am unable to thoroughly test it without the hardware. I will monitor the beta to see if users report any issues. If necessary, I will order a unit directly from your website. If you have a  discount code available, please feel free to share it. For reference, I am based in India, where the Chessnut Air is currently priced at approximately $250. Best regards, Nikhil On Wed, Jul 8, 2026 at 12:35 PM Stella Zhuang &lt; stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com &gt; wrote: Hi Nikhil, Yes, we can support this — but we’re currently out of stock for review units. I’ll add you to the priority list so we can send one out as soon as inventory becomes available. In the meantime, could you please share your full name, phone number, postal code, and shipping address so we have everything ready on our end? Best, Stella Business Development Manager | Chessnut ------------------------------------------------------------------ 发件人：C