      "subject": "Re: 回复：Chessnut July Updates – Sale, Companion & New App",
      "summary": "Thank you Stella! Right now, we are working on a comprehensive app that runs Stockfish 24/7 to find / come up with never seen before puzzles and studies. We have worked very hard on it, but we would love to be able to interface it with Chessnut and other board",
      "body": "Thank you Stella! Right now, we are working on a comprehensive app that\nruns Stockfish 24/7 to find / come up with never seen before puzzles and\nstudies. We have worked very hard on it, but we would love to be able to\ninterface it with Chessnut and other boards! Any documentation that\ncould help us is very much appreciated!\n\nBest,\n\nCyrus\n\nGadgetify\n\nOn 7/7/2026 5:11 AM, Stella Zhuang wrote:\n> Hi Cyrus,\n>\n> Thanks for your message — glad to hear you’re excited about the Companion.\n> We can definitely add you to the list and send one over once we have\n> stock available. I’ll let you know as soon as it’s ready to ship.\n> As for the custom app development question — I’ll check with our tech\n> team and get back to you on that.\n>\n> Best,\n> Stella\n> Business Development Manager | Chessnut\n>\n>\n> ------------------------------------------------------------------\n> 发件人：Gadgetify\n> 发送时间：2026年7月1日(周三) 06:03\n> 收件人：Stella Zhuang\n> 主　题：Re: Chessnut July Updates – Sale, Companion & New App\n>\n> Hi Stella,\n>\n> Great update. We would love to test the Chessnut Companion if it\n> is possible. I think we won a prize from you for being one of the\n> most active Chessnut posters? If you need tons of videos for the\n> Chessnut Companion, we can certainly deliver on that. I think it\n> would go great with the Chessnut Move.  We have done reviews of\n> DGT Pi in the past but this looks 100x times better. Very\n> exciting! One question: is it codable? Can we develop custom apps\n> for it?\n>\n> Kind Regards,\n>\n> Cyrus\n>\n> Gadgetify\n>\n> On 6/30/2026 5:39 AM, Stella Zhuang wrote:\n> Hi everyone,\n>\n> Long time no see — a few quick updates:\n>\n> 1. 6th Anniversary Sale (July 1–11)\n> 20% off storewide — your discount codes work too. We’ve been\n> running fewer discounts this year, so this is a good one to plan\n> content around. Good for board reviews, accessories, or anything\n> you want to feature. If you need us to boost anything, just send\n> the link.\n>\n> 2. Chessnut Companion Launch – July 3, 8:00 AM EST\n> First batch: 200 units at 20% off → $367.20.\n> Key features:\n> - AI coaching & real-time guidance\n> - Tournament-grade chess clock\n> - Voice control\n> - Works with Chess.com, Lichess, and more\n> - Motorized auto-switch\n> Compatible with all Chessnut boards except Evo. Only 200 units\n> available at this price, so it’s worth acting early. Interested?\n> Submit your content ideas — we’ll review them.\n>\n> 3. Chessnut Next – App Overhaul\n> We’re rolling out a completely redesigned app that turns the\n> Chessnut board into a full training ecosystem:\n> - Daily Task & Career mode — Gamified progression with tasks,\n> points, ELO, bosses, and challenges to keep you engaged every day.\n> - Maia3 integration — The latest human‑style AI engine helps you\n> understand why players at different levels tend to make certain\n> moves, not just what the best move is.\n> - Multiple analysis reports — Standard / Stockfish, Grandeur, and\n> Maia3 Human Review — so you can review the same game from three\n> angles: objective engine, coach-level explanation, and human‑style\n> insight.\n> - Progress tools — Mistake Book, themed puzzles, interactive\n> lessons, and Board Analyzer turn each game review into actionable\n> practice.\n> It’s currently in beta. If you’re interested in participating,\n> just let me know.\n>\n> Let me know if you have any questions!\n>\n> Best,\n> Stella\n> Business Development Manager | Chessnut\n>\n>\n--------------9XiBqM0D860lfWn0rcNG35de\nContent-Type: multipart/related;\nboundary=\"------------wKNzheWCWj1IL4Ie30mnnQ2k\"\n\n--------------wKNzheWCWj1IL4Ie30mnnQ2k\nContent-Type: text/html; charset=UTF-8\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n\nThank you Stella! Right now, we are working on a comprehensive\napp that runs Stockfish 24/7 to find / come up with never seen\nbefore puzzles and studies. We have worked very hard on it, but we\nwould love to be able to interface it with Chessnut and other\nboards! Any documentation that could help us is very much\nappreciated!\nBest,\nCyrus\nGadgetify\nOn 7/7/2026 5:11 AM, Stella Zhuang\nwrote:\n\nHi\nCyrus,\n\nThanks for your message — glad to\nhear you’re excited about the Companion.\nWe can definitely add you to the\nlist and send one over once we have stock available. I’ll\nlet you know as soon as it’s ready to ship.\nAs for the custom app development question — I’ll\ncheck with our tech team and get back to you on that.\n\nBest,\nStella\nBusiness Development Manager | Chessnut\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------\n发件人：Gadgetify\n&lt;gadgetify@gmail.com&gt;\n发送时间：2026年7月1日(周三) 06:03\n收件人：Stella\nZhuang &lt;stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com&gt;\n主　题：Re: Chessnut July Updates –\nSale, Companion &amp; New App\n\nHi\nStella,\nGreat\nupdate. We would love to test the Chessnut Companion if\nit is possible. I think we won a prize from you for\nbeing one of the most active Chessnut posters? If you\nneed tons of videos for the Chessnut Companion, we can\ncertainly deliver on that. I think it would go great\nwith the Chessnut Move.  We have done reviews of DGT Pi\nin the past but this looks 100x times better. Very\nexciting! One question: is it codable? Can we develop\ncustom apps for it?\nKind\nRegards,\nCyrus\nGadgetify\nOn 6/30/2026 5:39 AM, Stella\nZhuang wrote:\n\nHi\neveryone,\n\nLong time no see — a\nfew quick updates:\n\n1. 6th Anniversary\nSale (July 1–11)\n20% off storewide —\nyour discount codes work too. We’ve been\nrunning fewer discounts this year, so this is\na good one to plan content around. Good for\nboard reviews, accessories, or anything you\nwant to feature. If you need us to boost\nanything, just send the link.\n\n2. Chessnut\nCompanion Launch – July 3, 8:00 AM EST\nFirst batch: 200 units\nat 20% off → $367.20.\nKey features:\n- AI coaching &amp;\nreal-time guidance\n- Tournament-grade\nchess clock\n- Voice control\n- Works with\nChess.com, Lichess, and more\n- Motorized\nauto-switch\nCompatible with all\nChessnut boards except Evo. Only 200 units\navailable at this price, so it’s worth acting\nearly. Interested? Submit your content ideas —\nwe’ll review them.\n\n3. Chessnut Next –\nApp Overhaul\nWe’re rolling out a\ncompletely redesigned app that turns the\nChessnut board into a full training ecosystem:\n- Daily Task &amp;\nCareer mode — Gamified progression with tasks,\npoints, ELO, bosses, and challenges to keep\nyou engaged every day.\n- Maia3 integration —\nThe latest human‑style AI engine helps you\nunderstand why players at different levels\ntend to make certain moves, not just what the\nbest move is.\n- Multiple analysis\nreports — Standard / Stockfish, Grandeur, and\nMaia3 Human Review — so you can review the\nsame game from three angles: objective engine,\ncoach-level explanation, and human‑style\ninsight.\n- Progress tools —\nMistake Book, themed puzzles, interactive\nlessons, and Board Analyzer turn each game\nreview into actionable practice.\nIt’s currently in\nbeta. If you’re interested in participating,\njust let me know.\n\nLet me know if you have any questions!\n\nBest,\nStella\nBusiness Development Manager | Chessnut\n\n--------------wKNzheWCWj1IL4Ie30mnnQ2k\nContent-Type: image/png; name=\"temp4cj.png\"\nContent-Disposition: inline; filename=\"temp4cj.png\"\nContent-Id:\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: base64\n\niVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAApoAAANwCAYAAACPpMqvAAAgAElEQVR4nOydeXRcxZX/v/16\n71a31NosWau12bJkW5Ll3XjBGAPGCzH7hEBghi3kJGROMoFMZhJmJnOSyWSGBAayAYGwBDAE\nzGITg3FsbORdtiRLlmy0WNa+97693x8+t1z93LJFglh+uZ9zdCR1v/eqXlW9qm/de6ueDoAK\nhmGYzwCdTgdFUaCqKlT1bFekKAqi0aj42263Izc3FwUFBUhLS0N+fj7S0tKQk5ODzMxMJCYm\nYmxsDG+//TZ+9rOfoa+vD0ajUVwjGo1Cp9OJvxmGYZhPD8NnnQGGYf52IaEZDoeh0+nE/4qi\nwOVyoaCgADNnzkRVVRWqqqpQUlICq9WKEydOwOFwIDU1FUajEcePH8drr72GoaEhGAwGhEIh\n6HQ6GI1GAICqqkJsMgzDMJ8eLDQZhvnMICumwWAQYtDpdCInJwdLlizBxo0bsXDhQpjNZoyM\njKCrqwsdHR3YunUrqqursXjxYthsNnR1daGrqwvRaBQ2mw1+vx+qqgrraCQS+YzvlGEY5m8T\nFpoMw3xmk