      "body": "New support request from Chessnut website:\n\nName: Kenny Olajide\nEmail: olajidekenny56@gmail.com\nOrder Number: N/A\nInquiry Type: Business / Partnership\nProduct: Other / Not sure\n\nDescription:\nKind greetings, Chessnut Team\n\nI’ve been following your team’s work for some time and have been impressed by the evolution of the product, especially your expansion into the Playzone. It’s an exciting direction, and I’d love the opportunity to contribute.\n\nI’m a Product Designer with a strong background in both chess and product development. Before transitioning into product design, I worked as a chess content editor at Chessable and Forward Chess. I later became the Founding Product Designer at ChessEver alongside my co-designer, Dammy, and have since contributed to SmallChess. We are currently designing at Endgame.ai.\n\nI believe my experience, combined with my deep understanding of the chess ecosystem, would allow me to help create an even more polished, intuitive, and user-centered experience for your product.\n\nI’d be delighted to discuss how I can contribute to your team. I look forward to hearing from you.\n\nKind regards,\nKenny Olajide\n\nVideo Link: N/A\n\n---\nSubmitted via Chessnut Contact Form",
