      "summary": "*Subject:* Re: ChessNut & Peon de Rey - Stock order and wholesale pricing Hi Stella, Thank you for your reply, and congratulations on participating in the FIDE Team Championship! We are glad to hear that you support our proposal to invite customers to test the",
      "body": "*Subject:* Re: ChessNut & Peon de Rey - Stock order and wholesale pricing\n\nHi Stella,\n\nThank you for your reply, and congratulations on participating in the FIDE\nTeam Championship!\n\nWe are glad to hear that you support our proposal to invite customers to\ntest the machines at our physical store.\n\nTo move forward with this strategy and coordinate our initial stock\npurchase, please send us *your best wholesale/B2B pricing* for units of the\nfollowing three models:\n\n-\n\n*EVO*\n-\n\n*AIR+*\n-\n\n*GO*\n\nAs soon as you confirm the pricing, we will arrange the order details.\n\nLooking forward to your reply so we can finalize everything!\n\nBest regards,\nGM Miguel Illescas\nChess Education and Technology\nC/ Francisco Giner 42, Barcelona (Spain)\nTel. +34 93 415 40 93 / +34 629 50 11 20\nwww.edami.com / www.ajedrez21.com\nwww.peonderey.com / www.ajedrezyempresa.com\n\nEl mar, 23 jun 2026 a las 10:12, Stella Zhuang ( ) escribió:\n\n> Dear Miguel,\n>\n> I'm so sorry for the delayed reply — we were competing in the FIDE Rapid &\n> Blitz Team Championship, so I wasn't able to get back to you sooner. My\n> apologies.\n> I think your proposal is excellent — guiding people to visit your physical\n> store for a hands-on experience makes a lot of sense. We're definitely open\n> to that approach and would be happy to support it.\n>\n> Best,\n> Stella\n> Business Development Manager | Chessnut\n>\n>\n> ------------------------------------------------------------------\n> 发件人：Miguel Illescas\n> 发送时间：2026年6月18日(周四) 00:25\n> 收件人：Stella Zhuang\n> 主 题：Re: ChessNut & Peon de Rey\n>\n> Dear Stella\n> did you receive my last email?\n>\n> We need to receive your ad before Friday!\n>\n> Best regards\n> Miguel Illescas\n>\n> El dom, 14 jun 2026 a las 21:03, Miguel Illescas ( )\n> escribió:\n>\n>\n> El mié, 10 jun 2026 a las 20:18, Miguel Illescas ( )\n> escribió:\n> Dear Stella,\n> please find below the stats of the last email campaign, not bad, almost\n> 400 clics!\n>\n> We have to include a new ad in our printed magazine, July edition. What do\n> you have in mind? We need to have the ad in 7-10 days.\n>\n> We receive a lot of calls of people asking if they can test the machines\n> in our shop. That is why we may consider a return to our initial approach:\n> purchasing a stock of several units of your different chess machine models\n> to sell them directly here, in our physical store.\n>\n> As you know, our face-to-face customers highly value the experience of\n> seeing and testing the products. Therefore, we think it would be a great\n> idea for the new advertisement in the July edition to explicitly mention\n> that people can come directly to our store to try out the Chessnut machines\n> in person before buying. This would not only boost the impact of the ad and\n> attract more local enthusiasts, but it would also provide an excellent\n> hands-on showcase for your brand.\n>\n> Please let me know what you think about this approach so we can coordinate\n> the details for both the machine order and the final design of the\n> advertisement.\n>\n> Best regards,\n> Miguel Illescas\n>\n>\n>\n> [image: image.png]\n>\n> El lun, 20 abr 2026 a las 13:04, Miguel Illescas ( )\n> escribió:\n> Thanks Stella!\n>\n> We will send the April newsletter next week, because this week we have a\n> special promotion with books.\n> I will let you know.\n>\n> Best regards\n> Miguel Illescas\n>\n> El lun, 20 abr 2026 a las 12:50, Stella Zhuang ( stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com>) escribió:\n> Hi Miguel，\n>\n> Thank you for your patience. The Chessnut materials for your magazine page\n> have been completed.\n>\n>\n> https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1oXeRHysDPOoRYy0rf8ZoTBP84ANgWXdp?usp=sharing\n>\n> Best,\n> Stella\n> Business Development Manager | Chessnut\n> ------------------------------------------------------------------\n> 发件人：Miguel Illescas\n> 发送时间：2026年4月15日(周三) 19:21\n> 收件人：Stella Zhuang\n> 主 题：Re: ChessNut & Peon de Rey\n>\n> Excellent S