      "summary": "Hello Stella, Hope you are doing well. Unfortunately we didn't come across each other in Hong Kong, as far as I can tell at least. Busy week, lots to follow and many people around, really difficult to stay on top of everything 😄 We are starting work on our ne",
      "body": "Hello Stella,\n\nHope you are doing well.\nUnfortunately we didn't come across each other in Hong Kong, as far as I can tell at least. Busy week, lots to follow and many people around, really difficult to stay on top of everything 😄\n\nWe are starting work on our next season, kicking off in September, and beside our regular activities we are planning bigger events with a wider scope. Please let me know when we could catch up to explore collaborations.\n\nCheers,\nIngmar\n\n________________________________\nFrom: Stella Zhuang\nSent: 26 May 2026 18:36\nTo: Ingmar Potenza\nSubject: 回复：[Chessnut Support] Business / Partnership - Other / Not sure\n\nThanks Ingmar. Really nice to connect with you too. Do you have WeChat? Maybe we can stay in touch there and catch up at the event as well.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------\n发件人：Ingmar Potenza\n发送时间：2026年5月26日(周二) 17:25\n收件人：Stella Zhuang\n主　题：Re: [Chessnut Support] Business / Partnership - Other / Not sure\n\nHello Stella,\n\nAlways good to get in touch. It will be good to stay connected, we have a strong base and lots of ideas, so it would be interesting to see how we can collaborate in the future.\n\nCheers,\nIngmar\n\nOn 26 May 2026, at 17:12, Stella Zhuang wrote:\n\nHi,\n\nThanks for reaching out. We're also participating in the same championship in Hong Kong as a team, so sponsoring another team isn't the right fit for us at this time.\nThat said, I'd still love to stay in touch. Maybe we can connect during or after the event for a friendly chat or a short interview – no pressure, just a way to get to know each other. You never know – there might be a good opportunity to work together down the road.\nEither way, best of luck to your team in the championship!\n\nBest,\nStella\nBusiness Development Manager | Chessnut\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------\n发件人：contact\n发送时间：2026年5月26日(周二) 14:08\n收件人：\"stella.zhuang\"\n主　题：[Chessnut Support] Business / Partnership - Other / Not sure\n\nNew support request from Chessnut website:\n\nName: Ingmar Potenza\nEmail: ingmarpotenza@hotmail.com\nOrder Number: N/A\nInquiry Type: Business / Partnership\nProduct: Other / Not sure\n\nDescription:\nI&#x27;m reaching out regarding our chess club, Chess in Shanghai, which will be taking part in the FIDE World Team Rapid &amp; Blitz Chess Championship in Hong Kong. We are seeking collaborations with companies interested in supporting our effort, as a grassroots club, with a real community base in Shanghai, and also connected, and inspiring, multiple chess groups across China. It would be great if we can have an exchange about it.\n\nVideo Link: N/A\n\n---\nSubmitted via Chessnut Contact Form",
      "bodyChinese": "Hello Stella,\n\nHope you are doing well.\nUnfortunately we didn't come across each other in Hong Kong, as far as I can tell at least. Busy week, lots to follow and many people around, really difficult to stay on top of everything 😄\n\nWe are starting work on our next season, kicking off in September, and beside our regular activities we are planning bigger events with a wider scope. Please let me know when we could catch up to explore collaborations.\n\nCheers,\nIngmar\n\n________________________________\nFrom: Stella Zhuang\nSent: 26 May 2026 18:36\nTo: Ingmar Potenza\nSubject: 回复：[Chessnut Support] Business / Partnership - Other / Not sure\n\nThanks Ingmar. Really nice to connect with you too. Do you have WeChat? Maybe we can stay in touch there and catch up at the event as well.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------\n发件人：Ingmar Potenza\n发送时间：2026年5月26日(周二) 17:25\n收件人：Stella Zhuang\n主　题：Re: [Chessnut Support] Business / Partnership - Other / Not sure\n\nHello Stella,\n\nAlways good to get in touch. It will be good to stay connected, we have a strong base and lots of ideas, so it would be interesting to see how we can collaborate in the future.\n\nCheers,\nIngmar\n\nOn 26 May 2026, at 17:12, Stella Zhuang wrote:\n\nHi,\n\nThanks for reaching out. We're also participating in the same championship in Hong Kong as a team, so sponsoring another team isn't the right fit for us at this time.\nThat said, I'd still love to stay in touch. Maybe we can connect during or after the event for a friendly chat or a short interview – no pressure, just a way to get to know each other. You never know – there might be a good opportunity to work together down the road.\nEither way, best of luck to your team in the championship!\n\nBest,\nStella\nBusiness Development Manager | Chessnut\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------\n发件人：contact\n发送时间：2026年5月26日(周二) 14:08\n收件人：\"stella.zhuang\"\n主　题：[Chessnut 