      "id": "fe1bb88cb46d30c9b980",
      "threadId": "chessnut july updates – sale, companion & new app",
      "name": "Gadgetify",
      "email": "gadgetify@gmail.com",
      "subject": "Re: Chessnut July Updates – Sale, Companion & New App",
      "summary": "Hi Stella, Great update. We would love to test the Chessnut Companion if it is possible. I think we won a prize from you for being one of the most active Chessnut posters? If you need tons of videos for the Chessnut Companion, we can certainly deliver on that.",
      "body": "Hi Stella,\n\nGreat update. We would love to test the Chessnut Companion if it is\npossible. I think we won a prize from you for being one of the most\nactive Chessnut posters? If you need tons of videos for the Chessnut\nCompanion, we can certainly deliver on that. I think it would go great\nwith the Chessnut Move.  We have done reviews of DGT Pi in the past but\nthis looks 100x times better. Very exciting! One question: is it\ncodable? Can we develop custom apps for it?\n\nKind Regards,\n\nCyrus\n\nGadgetify\n\nOn 6/30/2026 5:39 AM, Stella Zhuang wrote:\n> Hi everyone,\n>\n> Long time no see — a few quick updates:\n>\n> 1. 6th Anniversary Sale (July 1–11)\n> 20% off storewide — your discount codes work too. We’ve been running\n> fewer discounts this year, so this is a good one to plan content\n> around. Good for board reviews, accessories, or anything you want to\n> feature. If you need us to boost anything, just send the link.\n>\n> 2. Chessnut Companion Launch – July 3, 8:00 AM EST\n> First batch: 200 units at 20% off → $367.20.\n> Key features:\n> - AI coaching & real-time guidance\n> - Tournament-grade chess clock\n> - Voice control\n> - Works with Chess.com, Lichess, and more\n> - Motorized auto-switch\n> Compatible with all Chessnut boards except Evo. Only 200 units\n> available at this price, so it’s worth acting early. Interested?\n> Submit your content ideas — we’ll review them.\n>\n> 3. Chessnut Next – App Overhaul\n> We’re rolling out a completely redesigned app that turns the Chessnut\n> board into a full training ecosystem:\n> - Daily Task & Career mode — Gamified progression with tasks, points,\n> ELO, bosses, and challenges to keep you engaged every day.\n> - Maia3 integration — The latest human‑style AI engine helps you\n> understand why players at different levels tend to make certain moves,\n> not just what the best move is.\n> - Multiple analysis reports — Standard / Stockfish, Grandeur, and\n> Maia3 Human Review — so you can review the same game from three\n> angles: objective engine, coach-level explanation, and human‑style\n> insight.\n> - Progress tools — Mistake Book, themed puzzles, interactive lessons,\n> and Board Analyzer turn each game review into actionable practice.\n> It’s currently in beta. If you’re interested in participating, just\n> let me know.\n>\n> Let me know if you have any questions!\n>\n> Best,\n> Stella\n> Business Development Manager | Chessnut\n>\n>\n--------------YMcxJ9pJSbGnsaUHHsWXmb3K\nContent-Type: multipart/related;\nboundary=\"------------RXQ00eFUf2NOxrwWPCMmAH1c\"\n\n--------------RXQ00eFUf2NOxrwWPCMmAH1c\nContent-Type: text/html; charset=UTF-8\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n\nHi Stella,\nGreat update. We would love to test the Chessnut Companion if it\nis possible. I think we won a prize from you for being one of the\nmost active Chessnut posters? If you need tons of videos for the\nChessnut Companion, we can certainly deliver on that. I think it\nwould go great with the Chessnut Move.  We have done reviews of\nDGT Pi in the past but this looks 100x times better. Very\nexciting! One question: is it codable? Can we develop custom apps\nfor it?\nKind Regards,\nCyrus\nGadgetify\nOn 6/30/2026 5:39 AM, Stella Zhuang\nwrote:\n\nHi\neveryone,\n\nLong time no see — a few quick\nupdates:\n\n1.\n6th Anniversary Sale (July 1–11)\n20% off storewide — your\ndiscount codes work too. We’ve been running fewer\ndiscounts this year, so this is a good one to plan\ncontent around. Good for board reviews, accessories, or\nanything you want to feature. If you need us to boost\nanything, just send the link.\n\n2.\nChessnut Companion Launch – July 3, 8:00 AM EST\nFirst batch: 200 units at 20%\noff → $367.20.\nKey features:\n- AI coaching &amp; real-time\nguidance\n- Tournament-grade chess clock\n- Voice control\n- Works with Chess.com, Lichess,\nand more\n- Motorized auto-switch\nCompatible with all Chessnut\nboards except Evo. Only 200 units available at this\nprice, so it’s worth acting early. Interested? Submit\nyour content ideas — we’ll review them.\n\n3.\nChessnut Next – App Overhaul\nWe’re rolling out a completely\nredesigned app that turns the Chessnut board into a full\ntraining ecosystem:\n- Daily Task &amp; Career mode —\nGamified progression with tasks, points, ELO, bosses,\nand challenges to keep you engaged every day.\n- Maia3 integration — The latest\nhuman‑style AI engine helps you understand why players\nat different levels tend to make certain moves, not just\nwhat the best move is.\n- Multiple analysis reports —\nStandard / Stockfish, Grandeur, and Maia3 Human Review —\nso you can review the same game from three angles:\nobjective engine, coach-level explanation, and\nhuman‑style insight.\n- Progress tools — Mistake Book,\nthemed puzzles, interactive lessons, and Board Analyzer\nturn each game review into actionable practice.\nIt’s currently in beta. If\nyou’re interested in participating, just let me know.\n\nLet me know if you have any questions!\n\nBest,\nStella\nBusiness Development Manager | Chessnut\n\n--------------RXQ00eFUf2NOxrwWPCMmAH1c\nContent-Type: image/png; name=\"temp4cj.png\"\nContent-Disposition: inline; filename=\"temp4cj.png\"\nContent-Id:\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: base64\n\niVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAApoAAANwCAYAAACPpMqvAAAgAElEQVR4nOydeXRcxZX/v/16\n71a31NosWau12bJkW5Ll3XjBGAPGCzH7hEBghi3kJGROMoFMZhJmJnOSyWSGBAayAYGwBDAE\nzGITg3FsbORdtiRLlmy0WNa+97693x8+t1z93LJFglh+uZ9zdCR1v/eqXlW9qm/de6ueDoAK\nhmGYzwCdTgdFUaCqKlT1bFekKAqi0aj42263Izc3FwUFBUhLS0N+fj7S0tKQk5ODzMxMJCYm\nYmxsDG+//TZ+9rOfoa+vD0ajUVwjGo1Cp9OJvxmGYZhPD8NnnQGGYf52IaEZDoeh0+nE/4qi\nwOVyoaCgADNnzkRVVRWqqqpQUlICq9WKEydOwOFwIDU1FUajEcePH8drr72GoaEhGAwGhEIh\n6HQ6GI1GAICqqkJsMgzDMJ8eLDQZhvnMICumwWAQYtDpdCInJwdLlizBxo0bsXDhQpjNZoyM\njKCrqwsdHR3YunUrqqursXjxYthsNnR1daGrqwvRaBQ2mw1+vx+qqgrraCQS+YzvlGEY5m8T\nFpoMw3xmkBXTZDLB7/fD5XJh48aNuP3221FRUYFoNAq3242Ojg688847ePLJJ9HS0gKdToeC\nggLYbDa4XC4sWbIEt956K371q1/B5/MhISEBHo8HoVBICE7ZPc8wDMN8eqj8wz/8wz+T9