      "summary": "------=_NextPart_000_000C_01DD0891.1489D3C0 Content-Type: multipart/alternative; boundary=\"----=_NextPart_001_000D_01DD0891.1489D3C0\" ------=_NextPart_001_000D_01DD0891.1489D3C0 Content-Type: text/plain; charset=\"UTF-8\" Content-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printa",
      "body": "------=_NextPart_000_000C_01DD0891.1489D3C0\nContent-Type: multipart/alternative;\nboundary=\"----=_NextPart_001_000D_01DD0891.1489D3C0\"\n\n------=_NextPart_001_000D_01DD0891.1489D3C0\nContent-Type: text/plain;\ncharset=\"UTF-8\"\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable\n\nHi Stella,\n\nGreat to hear from you, and congratulations on the 6th anniversary and these exciting new launches! The Chessnut Companion and the app overhaul sound fantastic.\n\nSince we received this update, I wanted to reach out. As you know, we have successfully collaborated in the past. When you mentioned earlier this year that you wouldn't be doing further collaborations for a while, we didn't want to insist. However, seeing these new features=E2=80=94especially the Chessnut Companion and the Maia3 integration=E2=80=94we know our audience would be incredibly interested.\n\nAt The Zugzwang Blog, we are fully available to help introduce these new products to the Spanish-speaking public. We can explore a new collaboration agreement across any of our main channels, depending on what fits your strategy best for this launch:\n\n* Our digital magazine\n* Our YouTube channel\n* Our website ( www.thezugzwangblog.com)\n\nThe new gamified features and human-style AI review are perfect for the type of educational content our community loves.\n\nLet me know if you would be open to renewed collaboration for July, and we can discuss some concrete content ideas for the Chessnut Companion or the app beta.\n\nBest regards,\n\nDaniel Mu=C3=B1oz Director | The Zugzwang Blog\n\n=20\n\n=20\n\nDe: Stella Zhuang =20\nEnviado el: martes, 30 de junio de 2026 11:39\nPara: contacto\nAsunto: Chessnut July Updates =E2=80=93 Sale, Companion & New App\n\n=20\n\nHi everyone,\n\n=20\n\nLong time no see =E2=80=94 a few quick updates:\n\n=20\n\n1. 6th Anniversary Sale (July 1=E2=80=9311)\n\n20% off storewide =E2=80=94 your discount codes work too. We=E2=80=99ve been running fewer discounts this year, so this is a good one to plan content around. Good for board reviews, accessories, or anything you want to feature. If you need us to boost anything, just send the link.\n\n=20\n\n2. Chessnut Companion Launch =E2=80=93 July 3, 8:00 AM EST\n\nFirst batch: 200 units at 20% off =E2=86=92 $367.20.\n\nKey features:\n\n- AI coaching & real-time guidance\n\n- Tournament-grade chess clock\n\n- Voice control\n\n- Works with Chess.com, Lichess, and more\n\n- Motorized auto-switch\n\nCompatible with all Chessnut boards except Evo. Only 200 units available at this price, so it=E2=80=99s worth acting early. Interested? Submit your content ideas =E2=80=94 we=E2=80=99ll review them.\n\n=20\n\n3. Chessnut Next =E2=80=93 App Overhaul\n\nWe=E2=80=99re rolling out a completely redesigned app that turns the Chessnut board into a full training ecosystem:\n\n- Daily Task & Career mode =E2=80=94 Gamified progression with tasks, points, ELO, bosses, and challenges to keep you engaged every day.\n\n- Maia3 integration =E2=80=94 The latest human=E2=80=91style AI engine helps you understand why players at different levels tend to make certain moves, not just what the best move is.\n\n- Multiple analysis reports =E2=80=94 Standard / Stockfish, Grandeur, and Maia3 Human Review =E2=80=94 so you can review the same game from three angles: objective engine, coach-level explanation, and human=E2=80=91style insight.\n\n- Progress tools =E2=80=94 Mistake Book, themed puzzles, interactive lessons, and Board Analyzer turn each game review into actionable practice.\n\nIt=E2=80=99s currently in beta. If you=E2=80=99re interested in participating, just let me know.\n\n=20\n\nLet me know if you have any questions!\n\n=20\n\nBest,\n\nStella\n\nBusiness Development Manager | Chessnut\n\n=20\n\n=20\n\n------=_NextPart_001_000D_01DD0891.1489D3C0\nContent-Type: text/html;\ncharset=\"UTF-8\"\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable\n\nHi Stella, Great to hear from you, and congratulations on the 6th anniversary and these exciting new launches! The Chessnut Companion and the app overhaul sound fantastic. Since we received this update, I wanted to reach out. As you know, we have successfully collaborated in the past. When you mentioned earlier this year that you wouldn't be doing further collaborations for a while, we didn't want to insist. However, seeing these new features=E2=80=94especially the Chessnut Companion and the Maia3 integration=E2=80=94we know our audience would be incredibly interested. At The Zugzwang Blog , we are fully available to help introduce these new products to the Spanish-speaking public. We can explore a new collaboration agreement across any of our main channels, depending on what fits your strategy best for this launch: Our digital magazine Our YouTube channel Our website ( www.thezugzwangblog.com ) The new gamified features and human-style AI review are perfect for the type of educational content our community loves. Let me know if you would be open to renewed collaboration for July, and we can discuss some concrete content ideas for the Chessnut Companion or the app beta. Best regards, Daniel Mu=C3=B1oz Director | The Zugzwang Blog &nbsp; &nbsp; De: Stella Zhuang &lt;stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com&gt; Enviado el: martes, 30 de junio de 2026 11:39 Para: contacto &lt;contacto@thezugzwangblog.com&gt; Asunto: Chessnut July Updates =E2=80=93 Sale, Companion &amp; New App &nbsp; Hi everyone, &nbsp; Long time no see =E2=80=94 a few quick updates: &nbsp; 1. 6th Anniversary Sale (July 1=E2=80=9311) 20% off storewide =E2=80=94 your discount codes work too. We=E2=80=99ve been running fewer discounts this year, so this is a good one to plan content around. Good for board reviews, accessories, or anything you want to feature. If you need us to boost anything, just send the link. &nbsp; 2. Chessnut Companion Launch =E2=80=93 July 3, 8:00 AM EST First batch: 200 units at 20% off =E2=86=92 $367.20. Key features: - AI coaching &amp; real-time guidance - Tournament-grade chess clock - Voice control - Works with Chess.com, Lichess, and more - Motorized auto-switch Compatible with all Chessnut boards except Evo. Only 200 units available at this price, so it=E2=80=99s worth acting early. Interested? Submit your content ideas =E2=80=94 we=E2=80=99ll review them. &nbsp; 3. Chessnut Next =E2=80=93 App Overhaul We=E2=80=99re rolling out a completely redesigned app that turns the Chessnut board into a full training ecosystem: - Daily Task &amp; Career mode =E2=80=94 Gamified progression with tasks, points, ELO, bosses, and challenges to keep you engaged every day. - Maia3 integration =E2=80=94 The latest human=E2=80=91style AI engine helps you understand why players at different levels tend to make certain moves, not just what the best move is. - Multiple analysis reports =E2=80=94 Standard / Stockfish, Grandeur, and Maia3 Human Review =E2=80=94 so you can review the same game from three angles: objective engine, coach-level explanation, and human=E2=80=91style insight. - Progress tools =E2=80=94 Mistake Book, themed puzzles, interactive lessons, and Board Analyzer turn each game review into actionable practice. It=E2=80=99s currently in beta. If you=E2=80=99re interested in participating, just let me know. &nbsp; Let me know if you have any questions! &nbsp; Best, Stella Business Development Manager | Chessnut &nbsp; &nbsp;\n------=_NextPart_001_000D_01DD0891.1489D3C0--\n\n------=_NextPart_000_000C_01DD0891.1489D3C0\nContent-Type: image/png;\nname=\"image005.png\"\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: base64\nContent-ID:\n\niVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAS8AAAGQCAYAAAD/QuZ4AAAAAXNSR0IArs4c6QAAAAlwSFlzAAAO\nxAAADsQBlSsOGwAAABl0RVh0U29mdHdhcmUATWljcm9zb2Z0IE9mZmljZX/tNXEAAP+QSURBVHhe\n7L0HgF3Xcd5/sItF7wAJAgR7702iqEI1S6K65N7tuMR2Esdxif2P7SR24pa4xjWyY1uWI1uKiiWq\nd5GiSFEixd4JEgRYQBC9Awvs4j+/mfu9N+/sfbsLkJJIcC+4fO/de+6pM9+ZmTNnzvRSyiH7m7qm\neqAMDg6WkZER74m5c+eWN7/5zeVtb3tbWbZsWTnnnHPKl770pfKjP/qj5eDBg552dHS0HDo0RT5T\npPOt6YHp35pip0p9NvaAgOvHfuzHyq/+6q86Q