ered down completely (board turned off, app closed, and everything fully disconnected), some of the pieces continue to twitch or make tiny unintended movements while resting on the board. I did a little digging online and it seems others may have encountered similar behaviour, so I wanted to ask whether this is a known issue and whether there’s a recommended fix, firmware update, reset procedure, or best practice to resolve it. This likely won’t impact our tournament demo on Sunday, so there’s no emergency—but I’d really like to understand what’s happening. As I begin sharing my thoughts on the product and potentially recommending it to our broader chess community of students, families, and chess enthusiasts, I’d love to be able to confidently explain whether this behaviour is expected, avoidable, or fixable. Because truthfully, I think this is a remarkable product with real appeal for chess-loving families and adult enthusiasts alike. If helpful, I’d also be happy to send along a short video of the twitching behaviour. Thanks again for all of your kindness and support—I’d really appreciate any guidance from you or your technical team. Warmly, Arash Shahi &quot;Mr. S&quot; Executive Director CHESS WITH MR. S INC. www.chesswithmrs.com Mobile: 416.456.1599 info@chesswithmrs.com shahiarash.s@gmail.com On Fri, May 8, 2026 at 3:42 AM Stella Zhuang &lt; stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com &gt; wrote: Hi  Arash, That should be it. The tracking number has been updated: 1ZB87K330420800754. Carrier: UPS. You should receive it soon. Best, Stella Business Development Manager | Chessnut ------------------------------------------------------------------ 发件人：Arash Shahi &lt; info@chesswithmrs.com &gt; 发送时间：2026年4月30日(周四) 23:44 收件人：Stella Zhuang&lt; stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com &gt; 主　题：Re: Collaboration Opportunity – Chessnut Move Feature Hi Stella, I hope you’re doing well, and my apologies for the slow response. We’re very excited to get started with this collaboration. I’ve gone ahead and completed the Uppromote application using the link you provided, and I’m looking forward to receiving the promotion code. We’re planning to share the code with all of our students’ families, especially those attending our upcoming tournament, and we’ll also be featuring the Chessnut Move at a demo station during the event. It should be a great opportunity for families to experience it firsthand. Thanks again, and please let me know if there’s anything further needed on my end. Warmly, Arash Shahi &quot;Mr. S&quot; Executive Director CHESS WITH MR. S INC. www.chesswithmrs.com Mobile: 416.456.1599 info@chesswithmrs.com shahiarash.s@gmail.com On Thu, Apr 23, 2026 at 1:58 AM Stella Zhuang &lt; stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com &gt; wrote: Hi, I hope this message finds you well! To kick off our affiliate collaboration, I’d like to invite you to join our affiliate program through Uppromote, a platform specifically designed to manage and track sales generated by affiliates like you. Please take a moment to fill out the Uppromote application using this link: https://af.uppromote.com/Chessnutech/register . Once registered, you’ll be assigned a unique promotion code, which will be used to track your performance and sales. After completing the registration, kindly let me know, and I’ll promptly process your application on the backend. When you post your video or live streaming, feel free to include your exclusive discount code, &quot;Your Code&quot;, in the description. Viewers using this code will enjoy a 12% or 17% discount (your discount will always be 2% higher than the official website’s discount at that time. I’ll inform you at the beginning of each month about the specific discount for that month, so you can update the description accordingly). For every converted sale made using your code, you’ll earn a 5% sales commission, ensuring transparency and fostering a mutually beneficial, long-term partnership. We’re excited to collaborate with you and look forward to seeing the results of your efforts! If you have any questions or need assistance, please don’t hesitate to reach out. Best, Stella Business Development Manager | Chessnut ------------------------------------------------------------------ 发件人：Arash Shahi &lt; info@chesswithmrs.com &gt; 发送时间：2026年4月22日(周三) 22:52 收件人：Stella Zhuang&lt; stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com &gt; 主　题：Re: Collaboration Opportunity – Chessnut Move Feature Hi Stella, Thank you for the update—I really appreciate it. We’re very excited to receive the Chessnut Move and to showcase it at our upcoming Spring Checkmate Festival and beyond. I think it’s going to be a fantastic addition. One small request on our end—we would strongly prefer the version with the wooden finish. From our experience working with families, the aesthetic and feel of wooden pieces resonates much more with parents, and I believe it will make an even stronger impression at our events. As we begin thinking about promotion, I’d love to set up a custom CWMS discount code for our families. We have a very engaged parent base, and especially through our tournaments and summer camps, I anticipate strong interest in the product. With that in mind, it would be great to align on how this will be structured—specifically, how code usage will be tracked and what kind of commission or revenue share would be in place for purchases made through our promotion. I see this as a strong opportunity for a mutually beneficial partnership, and I’d love to make sure we set it up properly from the start. Looking forward to your thoughts, and excited to get this going. Warmly, Arash Shahi &quot;Mr. S&quot; Executive Director CHESS WITH MR. S INC. www.chesswithmrs.com Mobile: 416.456.1599 info@chesswithmrs.com shahiarash.s@gmail.com On Wed, Apr 22, 2026 at 6:16 AM Stella Zhuang &lt; stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com &gt; wrote: Hi Arash, Thank you for sharing the shipping details. Just a heads-up – due to current inventory shortages, the unit may not ship until early 