ktok.com/@chess.with.mr.s/video/7624214657078775047 Our focus is always on creating authentic, experience-based content that genuinely resonates with our students and families, and we believe the Chessnut Move would be an exciting and natural fit within our programs. In addition, we host large-scale chess tournaments throughout the year, each reaching full capacity at 120 players, along with many attending family members and spectators. Our upcoming event, the CWMS Spring Checkmate Festival , will be held on May 24th. As part of this, we would be excited to showcase the Chessnut Move in a dedicated station at the event—giving students and families the opportunity to experience the board firsthand in a fun, interactive setting. I believe this would be a great way to introduce your product directly to a highly engaged and relevant audience. If this is something you’d be open to, I would be happy to create and share content across our platforms in addition to featuring the board at our event. I’d also be glad to discuss any specific goals or features you’d like highlighted to best support your brand. Thank you very much for your time and consideration—I’d love to explore this further. Warm regards,\nArash Shahi\nExecutive Director\nChess with Mr. S Inc. www.chesswithmrs.com\nMobile: 416.456.1599 info@chesswithmrs.com P.S. Our Spring Checkmate Festival on May 24th is approaching quickly, so if this is something you’d like to explore, I’d be happy to coordinate timing to feature the Chessnut Move at the event.\n\n109113:2750839",
