ortense,\n\nI've combined both contracts into a single document. Please see the attached file. Thanks!\n\nBest,\nStella\nBusiness Development Manager | Chessnut\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------\n发件人：Hortense\n发送时间：2026年6月5日(周五) 18:36\n收件人：Stella Zhuang\n主　题：RE: 回复：回复：回复：回复：回复：回复：Collaboration with Nathan Ryo Secher – Chessnut\n\nHi Stella,\n\nHope you're good !\n\nOlivia ask me for the signed contract. Is it possible to have it today ? Because tomorrow and sunday it's free day in France.\n\nThank you in advance,\nHave a good day🌞\nHortense\n\n[cid:3e05f728-252f-45d3-9c52-6bcaba8eb798]\n\nHortense Moro | Assistante Booking Influence\nParis | Bruxelles\n\n+33 1 42 71 88 99\n\nmyagencykids.com\nInstagram | Facebook | Linkedin\n\n________________________________\nDe : Stella Zhuang\nEnvoyé : mercredi 3 juin 2026 08:48\nÀ : Hortense\nObjet : 回复：回复：回复：回复：回复：回复：Collaboration with Nathan Ryo Secher – Chessnut\n\nHi Hortense,\n\nYes, received. I expect it to be signed by tomorrow.\n\nBest,\nStella\nBusiness Development Manager | Chessnut\n------------------------------------------------------------------\n发件人：Hortense\n发送时间：2026年6月2日(周二) 21:21\n收件人：Olivia Secher ; Stella Zhuang\n主　题：RE: 回复：回复：回复：回复：回复：Collaboration with Nathan Ryo Secher – Chessnut\n\nHi Stella,\n\nIs it good now ?\n\nThank\nHortense\n\n[cid:08354e5d-9851-4f86-860a-9da411bc7515]\n\nHortense Moro | Assistante Booking Influence\nParis | Bruxelles\n\n+33 1 42 71 88 99\n\nmyagencykids.com\nInstagram | Facebook | Linkedin\n\n________________________________\nDe : Stella Zhuang\nEnvoyé : mardi 2 juin 2026 12:56\nÀ : Olivia Secher ; Hortense\nObjet : 回复：回复：回复：回复：回复：Collaboration with Nathan Ryo Secher – Chessnut\n\nHi Hortense,\n\nI don't see the documents you mentioned. The attachments I received are images. Could you please send me the MAD and CT files?\n\nBest,\nStella\nBusiness Development Manager | Chessnut\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------