\nBusiness Development Manager | Chessnut\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------\n发件人：Hortense >\n发送时间：2026年5月13日(周三) 17:27\n收件人：Stella Zhuang >\n抄　送：\"Olivia.dureacuire\" >\n主　题：RE: 回复：回复：回复：Collaboration with Nathan Ryo Secher – Chessnut\n\nHi Stella,\n\nI hope you're doing well !\n\nCould you please send me the billing information (company name + address, company registration number) ?\nWith that, I’ll be able to send you the contract !! 🙂\n\nThank you,\nHortense\n\n[cid:1e1f6cc0-eff1-4607-8c8e-b0fd5bd53dd0]\n\nHortense Moro | Assistante Booking Influence\nParis | Bruxelles\n\n+33 1 42 71 88 99\n\nmyagencykids.com\nInstagram | Facebook | Linkedin\n\n________________________________\nDe : Stella Zhuang >\nEnvoyé : vendredi 17 avril 2026 12:59\nÀ : Hortense >\nCc : Olivia.dureacuire >\nObjet : 回复：回复：回复：Collaboration with Nathan Ryo Secher – Chessnut\n\nHi Hortense，\n\nUnderstood. We're happy to follow your process. Please go ahead and send us the contract and invoice as you described\n\nBest,\nStella\nBusiness Development Manager | Chessnut\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------\n发件人：Hortense >\n发送时间：2026年4月15日(周三) 17:28\n收件人：Stella Zhuang >\n抄　送：\"Olivia.dureacuire\" >\n主　题：RE: 回复：回复：Collaboration with Nathan Ryo Secher – Chessnut\n\nHello Stella,\nUnfortunately, it is not possible to pay via PayPal. An invoice is mandatory in order to justify payments and the children’s wages. In France, regulations are very strict on this matter.\nWe need to draw up a contract and send it to you for signature. Once the contract is signed, you will be able to proceed with payment by bank transfer upon receipt of the invoice. This will then allow us to pay the child.\nBest regards,\nHortense\n\n[cid:dc5a42e7-ff73-48d2-acb7-fbee906e85f4]\n\nHortense Moro | Assistante Booking Influence\nParis | Bruxelles\n\n+33 1 42 71 88 99\n\nmyagencykids.com\nInstagram | Facebook | Linkedin\n\n________________________________\nDe : Ste