an Grenier, Zedd, The Sound of Music, Sal Vulcano, Kenny Loggins, Kurt Sutter, Robert and Dean DeLeo of Stone Temple Pilots, Dick Van Dyke, Gary Busey, Ray J, Kevin Nealon of Saturday Night Live and many others. Instagram (399K Followers):&nbsp; https://www.instagram.com/blackmediapresents Facebook (811K Followers):&nbsp; https://www.facebook.com/sunnyandtheblackpack TikTok (591K Followers):&nbsp; https://www.tiktok.com/@blackmediapresents YouTube (64K Subscribers):&nbsp; https://www.youtube.com/blackmediapresents Here are links to collaborations, along with our social channels: https://linktr.ee/BlackMediaContact We'd love to explore ways we can bring Chessnut to even more people through content, studio integration, social media, and celebrity moments. Please let us know if you have any ideas or if you’d like to schedule a Google Meet so we can discuss further.&nbsp; Thank you so much! Warmest regards, Tammy Byerly Strategic Partnerships Black Media Co., LLC https://linktr.ee/BlackMediaContact\n--Apple-Mail=_69245FC9-1272-4B4A-9CDB-349CF0C95CB3--",
