      "bodyChinese": "To ensure everything goes smoothly and to comply with local tax regulations, we would like to confirm that Chessnut will handle the shipping of the 3 boards directly to the winners. Once the series concludes and the raffle is complete, I will provide you with the shipping addresses and contact details of the 3 winners, so your team can send the prizes straight to them. Please let me know if this works for you.\n\nDnia 26 czerwca 2026 08:32\nStella Zhuang &lt; stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com &gt; napisał(a):\n\nHi Krzysztof, Thanks for the detailed response — this is very helpful. On co-created content: I was thinking we could tag each other when posting Shorts or Reels, so Chessnut’s 60K followers can also discover the tournament. I think that could be a nice boost for visibility on your side too. Also, it might be helpful to feature the prize boards briefly in Marianczello’s video — showing the actual products could make them more appealing to players. The Move is quite popular right now, so that could generate some extra interest. Before we confirm the prize commitment, I have a couple of questions: - Are there other brand sponsors involved in the series besides Chessnut? If so, could you share who they are? - How will the 3 Chessnut boards be used across the 10 tournaments? Will they be awarded at the final Grand Prix standings, or distributed across individual events? - If there are other sponsors, will the Chessnut boards be presented as standalone prizes, or grouped together with other sponsor items? Also, could you confirm the timeline for Marianczello’s YouTube videos and mentions? Looking forward to your reply! Best, Stella Business Development Manager | Chessnut ------------------------------------------------------------------ 发件人：krzysiekdettlaff@wp.pl &lt;krzysiekdettlaff@wp.pl&gt; 发送时间：2026年6月25日(周四) 18:36 收件人：Stella Zhuang&lt;stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com&gt; 主　题：Odp: 回复：Partnership X Marianczello Decade Series Hi Stella, I am the 