      "body": "Hi Stella,\n\nIt was nice to meet you in Hong Kong. I hope your team had a fruitful trip.\nIf there's any way I can help with Chessnut in the future, please let me\nknow. As a Chinese American, I've really appreciated collaborating with\npeople from both China and the US in chess. In the past, I've done some\nChinese/English translation, media work, and event planning, if any of\nthose would be useful. All the best to you!\n\nJonathan\n\nHi Stella, It was nice to meet you in Hong Kong. I hope your team had a fruitful trip. If there&#39;s any way I can help with Chessnut in the future, please let me know. As a Chinese American, I&#39;ve really appreciated collaborating with people from both China and the US in chess.  In the past, I&#39;ve done some Chinese/English translation, media work, and event planning, if any of those would be useful. All the best to you! Jonathan\n\n%PDF-1.4\n%����\n1 0 obj\n>\nendobj\n3 0 obj\n>\nendobj\n4 0 obj\n>\nendobj\n10 0 obj\n> stream\nx��}�$9r��~��\u0002\u001b˸0H\u0002�\u0005f��\u0005\u0001^���\u0005��\u00050$Öe��oDu���*F&Ɋ��+\u001d�4Ss2�L&\u0019��/�%��\u0001_�Ki����?@ɷ����\u001f����������˿��?������`�W�\u0017LY_��\u001f?�Ӈ�vw�B/H ��ڪ]�~Hv�/���Zb���}��?����~zI/��/�>~H/X�\n!���$���\u000f׻�d��D��~�����p�F%U�v�ퟝ��6\u0010�:s;�v�\u0006���}�g�v�\u0019�I%9}/w7��M_�K&\u0005�9�\u0017T����uR�\n� ��Wg�1A�IΏ�^�\n�h+ G\u0005����z�r�_w�D���`iF\u001b\u0002�ҴN/�C\u0015gx��֍N���@zQ�U���B���:G\u0015g�6��8��-\u000bG��0�o\u001b?'/Y:��� ݊���n��~��������J���:~�z����b���E��Cܔ\\�=�����i�g\u0015\u001f�\"27�+^�X�B��ٖo��\u0016��3+�Co�\u0017�\u0018�nsL5{X$g\u0014�e�A���u=!^�]\u0006�Me ��JR�\u001fLO��\u0017�^6��!�b\u001b����ְ�3�ݛ�(���tt�6z�B�\u001f���'�\u0006lWY�M�g�V4k�\"���X��B� y�\u0006�%�|\u0016\"�\u0015���I0�_��Ǣ\u0003\u001f�P���\u0016�>��$H�\"Om)\f%k��\u001e\u0003\u0007��u\u0007�\u001b~���\u001aE��9%Ь[��n\\\u001f��2�D���\u0016ee��Zbs\u0019�ʆ\u001e|\u001c֧]\\���r�~\u0004� �ڞ�\u0019�4�$[U�x����Y���H\u0010]�cD@��\u0006E\"���\u0