      "summary": "Hi Stella, I don’t seem to have a separate customs tax receipt, but I do have the *FedEx payment confirmation email*. If you want, I can forward it to you. It says “Please keep this email as proof of payment” and includes the amount paid, tracking ID and recei",
      "body": "Hi Stella,\n\nI don’t seem to have a separate customs tax receipt, but I do have the *FedEx\npayment confirmation email*. If you want, I can forward it to you.\n\nIt says “Please keep this email as proof of payment” and includes the\namount paid, tracking ID and receipt number:\n\n- Amount paid: EUR 25.38\n- Tracking ID: 872987813720\n- Receipt number: 93906938\n\nI’m attaching a screenshot of the email, as well as the documents I was\nable to download from https://fit.clearance.fedex.com/ in a zip file,\nincluding the proof of delivery.\n\nI couldn’t download any invoice from there because it says “payment\npending”, although if I try to pay again, it says “You have already made\nthe payment”, so I’m honestly a bit confused.\n\nIf I can help with anything else, just let me know. Sorry I can’t provide\nanything more specific, but I’ve looked everywhere on their platform and\ncouldn’t find anything else.\n\nAnd thank you so much for looking into it. Please don’t worry too much\nabout it, I just wanted to let you know in case something had gone wrong\nwith the shipment.\n\nAlso, great to hear about the Chessnut Updates emails, they were really\nhelpful, so I’m glad they’ll be coming back :)\n\nBest,\nIvan\n\nEl jue, 25 jun 2026 a las 12:26, Stella Zhuang ( ) escribió:\n\n> Hi Ivan，\n>\n> Could you please forward the customs tax receipt you received? That would\n> help us check with the carrier on our end.\n>\n> ------------------------------------------------------------------\n> 发件人：Stella Zhuang\n> 发送时间：2026年6月25日(周四) 18:12\n> 收件人：Resourchess\n> 主 题：回复：Chessnut Companion – New Product Collaboration Invitation\n>\n> Hi Ivan,\n>\n> Thanks for letting us know, we really appreciate it. This customs charge\n> doesn’t seem right, and we’ll look into it with the carrier right away. If\n> we can’t get it refunded, we’ll reimburse you directly.I’m also really\n> glad to hear you find the ‘Chessnut Updates’ emails helpful. I’ll make sure\n> to resume them as soon as possible.\n>\n> Best,\n> Stella\n> Business Development Manager | Chessnut\n>\n> ------------------------------------------------------------------\n> 发件人：Resourchess\n> 发送时间：2026年6月24日(周三) 23:27\n> 收件人：Stella Zhuang\n> 主 题：Re: Chessnut Companion – New Product Collaboration Invitation\n>\n> Hi Stella,\n>\n> I hope you’re doing great!\n>\n> I just wanted to let you know that the Chessnut Companion arrived safely,\n> and it looks amazing. The “Resourchess” engraving is such a great detail.\n> Thank you again, I really appreciate it 😃\n>\n> I’ll start creating content with it on my social media in the next few\n> days, and hopefully some YouTube content soon as well.\n>\n> Also, I wanted to mention that I had to pay €25.38 in customs fees to\n> receive it. It’s not a problem at all, and I understand it wasn’t\n> intentional, but I just wanted to let you know in case it also happens with\n> other partners, and there's anything that can be done to prevent it.Maybe\n> some import/export rules have changed recently?\n>\n> One more quick question: are you planning to continue sending the\n> “Chessnut Updates” emails? They were really useful for knowing current\n> promotions or upcoming campaigns and planning content around them. No\n> problem if they’re paused, I just wanted to check.\n>\n> Thanks again for the Companion and the engraving!\n>\n> Best,\n> Ivan\n>\n> El mié, 20 may 2026 a las 12:38, Resourchess ( )\n> escribió:\n> Hi Stella,\n>\n> Wow, thank you so much for the engraving, that’s such a cool detail!\n>\n> I think simply “ *Resourchess *” would look really clean and elegant :)\n>\n> Thank you very very much!\n> Ivan\n>\n> El mié, 20 may 2026 a las 11:09, Stella Zhuang ( stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com>) escribió:\n> Hi Ivan,\n>\n> Thanks again for your high recognition of Chessnut. I really appreciate it.\n> Regarding the details of how it works and what's included, I'm still\n> organizing the information. I will share a brief with you later so you can\n> h