ur platforms (over 1.8M followers), studio product placement, targeted celebrity gifting, etc. But we would have a much clearer idea after testing it out in the environment.&nbsp; We love the recommendation of two Chessnut Move units, one with wooden pieces and one with plastic. That variety gives us great options visually and the auto-moving will be extremely engaging and striking in-person and on camera. Thank you so much! Warmest regards, Tammy On Apr 17, 2026, at 1:54 AM, Stella Zhuang &lt;stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com&gt; wrote: ﻿ Hi Tammy, Thanks for the message — we're excited too. Just a few quick questions: When are you thinking of testing the boards? (rough timeline) If Howie likes it, what kind of exposure are you expecting? (IG post, podcast, video, etc.) After testing, what kind of collab do you have in mind? (product placement, content, etc.) We recommend sending two Chessnut Move units — one with wooden pieces, one with plastic pieces. Same model, different look. The auto-moving feature is great for camera. Let us know your thoughts. Best, Stella Business Development Manager | Chessnut ------------------------------------------------------------------ 发件人：BlackMedia Partnerships &lt;partner@blackmediapresents.com&gt; 发送时间：2026年4月17日(周五) 15:45 收件人：Stella Zhuang&lt;stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com&gt; 主　题：Re: Chessnut // BlackMediaPresents - Partnership Inquiry Hi Stella, I wanted to check in and see if you had any questions or thoughts on everything we shared. We are very excited about the possibilities here and happy to chat through anything! Looking forward to hearing from you! Warmest regards, Tammy On Apr 10, 2026, at 2:41 AM, BlackMedia Partnerships &lt;partner@blackmediapresents.com&gt; wrote: Hi Stella, Thank you so much for your thoughtful response. We are very excited about what's possible here! To best understand what's realistic and structure a partnership that truly suits Chessnut, we'd love to start by testing two units, one at Howie's studio