      "body": "Dear Stella, Thank you for the quick response! I am very excited about your interest in collaborating. To give you more details about the event: I am the official organizer of the Marianczello Decade Series —a prestigious cycle of 10 tournaments celebrating Marianczello&#39;s 10th anniversary of chess content creation. He is the biggest chess YouTuber in Poland, with a community of over 150,000 subscribers and 50,000 members in our Chess.com Chess.com club. Initially, I mentioned a single board, but after finalizing the tournament structure, we would love to upgrade this to a partnership involving 3 Chessnut boards . This will allow us to create a massive buzz and maximize the marketing value for Chessnut across the entire 10-tournament cycle: 1st Board: The ultimate Grand Prix prize for the overall winner of the Decade Series. 2nd Board: The prize for the runner-up (2nd place) in the final standings. 3rd Board: A grand raffle prize for all participants. At the end of the series, we will host a big giveaway drawing from everyone who played, which is the perfect tool to keep everyday amateur players highly engaged and active from the first to the very last tournament. In exchange for these 3 boards, we will provide an extensive promotional campaign: Club Homepage Banner: A prominent Chessnut banner on our main Chess.com Chess.com club page for the entire duration of the series. Dedicated Articles &amp; Newsletters: Official tournament announcements on Chess.com Chess.com with direct links to your store, sent to our 50,000 club members. YouTube Video Integration: Marianczello will personally provide dedicated sponsor shoutouts, mention your brand in his videos, and include direct links in the descriptions of his tournament coverage videos on YouTube. This setup ensures high, long-term player engagement and puts Chessnut products directly in front of thousands of passionate Polish chess players for months. Please let me know if this expanded package works for you! Best regards, Krzysztof Dettlaff Tournament Organizer www.chess.com https://www.chess.com/events/info/marianczello-decade-series m.youtube.com https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=41iJsK6L7mI 1:20 Last video and Youtuber talk about tournament and sponsors :)\n\n--10FKNUMBIQJAWEQPSMBTDUnhgwp\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable\nContent-Type: text/html; charset=UTF-8\n\nDear Stella, Thank you for the quick response! I am very excited about your interest in collaborating. To give you more details about the event: I am the official organizer of the Marianczello Decade Series —a prestigious cycle of 10 tournaments celebrating Marianczello's 10th anniversary of chess content creation. He is the biggest chess YouTuber in Poland, with a community of over 150,000 subscribers and 50,000 members in our Chess.com club. Initially, I mentioned a single board, but after finalizing the tournament structure, we would love to upgrade this to a partnership involving 3 Chessnut boards . This will allow us to create a massive buzz and maximize the marketing value for Chessnut across the entire 10-tournament cycle: 1st Board: The ultimate Grand Prix prize for the overall winner of the Decade Series. 2nd Board: The prize for the runner-up (2nd place) in the final standings. 3rd Board: A grand raffle prize for all participants. At the end of the series, we will host a big giveaway drawing from everyone who played, which is the perfect tool to keep everyday amateur players highly engaged and active from the first to the very last tournament. In exchange for these 3 boards, we will provide an extensive promotional campaign: Club Homepage Banner: A prominent Chessnut banner on our main Chess.com club page for the entire duration of the series. Dedicated Articles &amp; Newsletters: Official tournament announcements on Chess.com with direct links to your store, sent to our 50,000 club members. YouTube Video Integration: Marianczello will personally provide dedicated sponsor shoutouts, mention your brand in his videos, and include direct links in the descriptions of his tournament coverage videos on YouTube. This setup ensures high, long-term player engagement and puts Chessnut products directly in front of thousands of passionate Polish chess players for months. Please let me know if this expanded package works for you! Best regards, Krzysztof Dettlaff Tournament Organizer https://www.chess.com/events/info/marianczello-decade-series https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=41iJsK6L7mI 1:20 Last video and Youtuber talk about tournament and sponsors :)\n--10FKNUMBIQJAWEQPSMBTDUnhgwp--\n\n--3LJWWMVVUFRHVHAIHTFCRnhgwp\nContent-Disposition: attachment; filename=\"=?utf-8?b?ZmlsZV8wMDAwMDAwMGZhZTg3MjBhOTJkNjBkYzg5ODliZmRhMi5wbmc=?=\"\nContent-Id:\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: base64\nContent-Type: image/png\n\niVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAABgAAAAQACAIAAACoEwUVAABhWmNhQlgAAGFaanVtYgAAAB5qdW1k\nYzJwYQARABCAAACqADibcQNjMnBhAAAAYTRqdW1iAAAAR2p1bWRjMm1hABEAEIAAAKoAOJtxA3Vy\nbjpjMnBhOjMxNWQ0ZDU2LTQ0MzctNDVjMi1hZjgxLThhNDIxNjg5MjE2OQAAABf9anVtYgAAAClq\ndW1kYzJhcwARABCAAACqADibcQNjMnBhLmFzc2VydGlvbnMAAAAJ0Wp1bWIAAAA7anVtZEDLDDK7\nikidpwsq1vR/Q2kTYzJwYS5pY29uAAAAABhjMnNoWvL6/8awDFpLST4YBhZeWwAAABdiZmRiAGlt\nYWdlL3N2Zyt4bWwAAAAJd2JpZGI8c3ZnIHdpZHRoPSI3MTYiIGhlaWdodD0iNzE2IiB2aWV3Qm94\nPSIwIDAgNzE2IDcxNiIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAv\nc3ZnIj4KPHBhdGggZD0iTTUwOC43NDkgMzE3LjM5OUM1MTYuNzc3IDI4Ny4zMTQgNTA4Ljk5MSAy\nNTMuODg0IDQ4NS4zODkgMjMwLjI4MkM0NjEuNzg4IDIwNi42ODEgNDI4LjM2IDE5OC44OTUgMzk4\nLjI3MyAyMDYuOTIzQzM3Ni4yMzEgMTg0LjkyOCAzNDMuMzkgMTc0Ljk1NiAzMTEuMTQ4IDE4My41\nOTZDMjc4LjkwNiAxOTIuMjM0IDI1NS40NSAyMTcuMjkyIDI0Ny4zNiAyNDcuMzYxQzIxNy4yOTEg\nMjU1LjQ1MSAxOTIuMjMzIDI3OC45MSAxODMuNTk1IDMxMS4xNDlDMTc0Ljk1NyAzNDMuMzkxIDE4\nNC45MjcgMzc2LjIzMiAyMDYuOTI0IDM5OC4yNzRDMTk4Ljg5NiA0MjguMzU5IDIwNi42ODMgNDYx\nLjc4OSAyMzAuMjg0IDQ4NS4zOTFDMjUzLjg4NSA1MDguOTkyIDI4Ny4zMTMgNTE2Ljc3OSAzMTcu\nNDAxIDUwOC43NUMzMzkuNDQyIDUzMC43NDUgMzcyLjI4NiA1NDAuNzE3IDQwNC41MjUgNTMyLjA3\nOUM